msgid ""
"Now that you can generate a JWT to access our secured REST endpoints, let's "
"see what more you can do with the `JsonWebToken` interface and the JWT "
"claims.\n"
"The `org.eclipse.microprofile.jwt.JsonWebToken` interface extends the `java."
"security.Principal` interface, and is the object type returned by the "
"`jakarta.ws.rs.core.SecurityContext#getUserPrincipal()` call you used "
"previously.\n"
