"The `@RequestScoped` scope is required to enable injection of the "
"`birthdate` claim as a `String`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `JsonWebToken` is injected here, providing access to all claims and JWT-"
"related information."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `birthdate` claim is injected as a `String`. This highlights why the "
"`@RequestScoped` scope is mandatory."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The injected `birthdate` claim is directly used to construct the response."
msgstr ""

