"`@ApplicationScoped`, `@Singleton` and `@RequestScoped` outer bean injection "
"scopes are all supported when an `org.eclipse.microprofile.jwt.JsonWebToken` "
"is injected, with the `@RequestScoped` scoping for `JsonWebToken` enforced "
"to ensure the current token is represented."
